{
  "$comment": "Realisation (docs/rules-design.md; docs/rules/yue.md). realise/equals: a token of equals (several lexemes, none of them its base), on zz, an invented fixture language given whole. realise/yue: yue's own lexicon (lexicons/yue), which has no realisation rule: words in their citation cells, a token's lexemes joined, the A-not-A allomorph, tokens of equals.",
